           <span>2026-11-18 19:37</span>\n                                                    </p>\n                                                </div>\n        \n                                <section>\n                                                <pre>①谷歌近日与地热初创公司Quaise签署协议，将最早于2030年起购买50兆瓦超高温地热电力；\n                                    ②Quaise项目二期有望全球首次应用毫米波钻探技术，以非接触方式汽化岩石；\n                                    ③Quaise首席执行官估计，该项目未来十年发电能力可能达到约1吉瓦。</pre>\n                                            </section>\n        \n                                <div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <p>14.8w+ 阅读</p>\n                                            <div data-href=\"https://sj.qq.com/appdetail/com.lanjinger.choiassociatedpress\" data-openapplink=\"cailianpressopen://open?articleid=2538173&articletype=ordinary\">\n                                                \n                                                    <p>4</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div data-href=\"https://sj.qq.com/appdetail/com.lanjinger.choiassociatedpress\" data-openapplink=\"cailianpressopen://open?articleid=2538173&articletype=ordinary\">\n                                                \n                                                    <p>27</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div data-id=\"2538173\">\n                                            <p>展开</p>\n                                            \n                                        </div>\n                                    <div data-id=\"2538173\">\n                                            <p>收起</p>\n                                            \n                                        </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                    </ul>\n       